{
 "0001": {
  "title": "",
  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "h4_00001",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[A1][/A1]NAME",
    "placeholders": {
     "A1": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_482_01\" id=\"tag_17_482_01\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     13
    ],
    "text": "recv — receive a message from a connected socket",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_482_02\" id=\"tag_17_482_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_socket.h.html\">sys/socket.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nssize_t recv(int</tt> <i>socket</i><tt>, void *</tt><i>buffer</i><tt>, size_t</tt> <i>length</i><tt>, int</tt>\n<i>flags</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_482_03\" id=\"tag_17_482_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]recv[/I5]() function shall receive a message from a connection-mode or connectionless-mode socket. It is normally used\nwith connected sockets because it does not permit the application to retrieve the source address of received data.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I6]recv[/I6]() function takes the following arguments:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00008",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[I7]socket[/I7]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00009",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     5
    ],
    "text": "Specifies the socket file descriptor.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00010",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[I8]buffer[/I8]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I8": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00011",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     9
    ],
    "text": "Points to a buffer where the message should be stored.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00012",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[I9]length[/I9]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I9": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00013",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     13
    ],
    "text": "Specifies the length in bytes of the buffer pointed to by the [I10]buffer[/I10] argument.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I10": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00014",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[I11]flags[/I11]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I11": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00015",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5,
     17
    ],
    "text": "Specifies the type of message reception. Values of this argument are formed by logically OR'ing zero or more of the following\nvalues:\n\n\nMSG_PEEK\nPeeks at an incoming message. The data is treated as unread and the next [I12]recv[/I12]() or similar function shall still return\nthis data.\nMSG_OOB\nRequests out-of-band data. The significance and semantics of out-of-band data are protocol-specific.\nMSG_WAITALL\nOn SOCK_STREAM sockets this requests that the function block until the full amount of data can be returned. The function may\nreturn the smaller amount of data if the socket is a message-based socket, if a signal is caught, if the connection is terminated,\nif MSG_PEEK was specified, or if an error is pending for the socket.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I12": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00016",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The [I13]recv[/I13]() function shall return the length of the message written to the buffer pointed to by the [I14]buffer[/I14]\nargument. For message-based sockets, such as SOCK_DGRAM and SOCK_SEQPACKET, the entire message shall be read in a single operation.\nIf a message is too long to fit in the supplied buffer, and MSG_PEEK is not set in the [I15]flags[/I15] argument, the excess bytes\nshall be discarded. For stream-based sockets, such as SOCK_STREAM, message boundaries shall be ignored. In this case, data shall be\nreturned to the user as soon as it becomes available, and no data shall be discarded.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I13": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I14": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I15": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00017",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     9
    ],
    "text": "If the MSG_WAITALL flag is not set, data shall be returned only up to the end of the first message.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00018",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     11
    ],
    "text": "If no messages are available at the socket and O_NONBLOCK is not set on the socket's file descriptor, [I16]recv[/I16]() shall block\nuntil a message arrives or a timeout occurs (see SO_RCVTIMEO in [A17][I18]2.10.16 Use\nof Options[/I18][/A17]). If no messages are available at the socket and O_NONBLOCK is set on the socket's file descriptor,\n[I19]recv[/I19]() shall fail and set [I20]errno[/I20] to [EAGAIN] or [EWOULDBLOCK].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I16": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A17": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/V2_chap02.html#tag_16_10_16\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I18": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I19": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I20": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00019",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A21][/A21]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A21": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_482_04\" id=\"tag_17_482_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00020",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, [I22]recv[/I22]() shall return the length of the message in bytes. If no messages are available to be\nreceived and the peer has performed an orderly shutdown, [I23]recv[/I23]() shall return 0. Otherwise, -1 shall be returned and\n[I24]errno[/I24] set to indicate the error.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I22": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I23": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I24": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00021",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[A25][/A25]ERRORS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A25": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_482_05\" id=\"tag_17_482_05\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00022",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I26]recv[/I26]() function shall fail if:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I26": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00023",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EAGAIN] or [EWOULDBLOCK]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00024",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The socket's file descriptor is marked O_NONBLOCK and no data is waiting to be received; or MSG_OOB is set and no out-of-band data\nis available and either the socket's file descriptor is marked O_NONBLOCK or the socket does not support blocking to await\nout-of-band data. See also SO_RCVTIMEO in [A27][I28]2.10.16 Use of Options[/I28][/A27]\n.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A27": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/V2_chap02.html#tag_16_10_16\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I28": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00025",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[EBADF]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00026",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The [I29]socket[/I29] argument is not a valid file descriptor.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I29": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00027",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[ECONNRESET]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00028",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     13
    ],
    "text": "A connection was forcibly closed by a peer.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00029",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[EINTR]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00030",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     17
    ],
    "text": "The [I30]recv[/I30]() function was interrupted by a signal that was caught, before any data was available.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I30": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00031",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[EINVAL]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00032",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     21
    ],
    "text": "The MSG_OOB flag is set and no out-of-band data is available.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00033",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[ENOTCONN]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00034",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     25
    ],
    "text": "A receive is attempted on a connection-mode socket that is not connected.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00035",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[ENOTSOCK]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00036",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     29
    ],
    "text": "The [I31]socket[/I31] argument does not refer to a socket.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I31": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00037",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     31
    ],
    "text": "[EOPNOTSUPP]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00038",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     33
    ],
    "text": "The specified flags are not supported for this socket type or protocol.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00039",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     35
    ],
    "text": "[ETIMEDOUT]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00040",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     37
    ],
    "text": "The connection timed out during connection establishment, or due to a transmission timeout on active connection.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00041",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The [I32]recv[/I32]() function may fail if:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I32": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00042",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EIO]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00043",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     5
    ],
    "text": "An I/O error occurred while reading from or writing to the file system.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00044",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[ENOBUFS]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00045",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     9
    ],
    "text": "Insufficient resources were available in the system to perform the operation.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00046",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[ENOMEM]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00047",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     13
    ],
    "text": "Insufficient memory was available to fulfill the request.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00048",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     35
    ],
    "text": "[A33][/A33]EXAMPLES",
    "placeholders": {
     "A33": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_482_06\" id=\"tag_17_482_06\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00049",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     37,
     1
    ],
    "text": "None.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00050",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     39
    ],
    "text": "[A34][/A34]APPLICATION USAGE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A34": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_482_07\" id=\"tag_17_482_07\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00051",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     41,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I35]recv[/I35]() function is equivalent to [A36][I37]recvfrom[/I37]()[/A36] with null pointer\n[I38]address[/I38] and [I39]address_len[/I39] arguments, and to [A40][I41]read[/I41]()[/A40] if the [I42]socket[/I42]\nargument refers to a socket and the [I43]flags[/I43] argument is 0.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I35": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A36": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/recvfrom.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I37": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I38": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I39": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A40": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/read.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I41": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I42": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I43": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00052",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     41,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [A44][I45]select[/I45]()[/A44] and [A46][I47]poll[/I47]()[/A46] functions can\nbe used to determine when data is available to be received.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A44": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/select.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I45": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A46": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/poll.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I47": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00053",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     43
    ],
    "text": "[A48][/A48]RATIONALE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A48": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_482_08\" id=\"tag_17_482_08\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00054",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     45,
     1
    ],
    "text": "None.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
